{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226660","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226660","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422666001:1":{"text":"首先，关于弥萨忒的怒火来由，是在于违逆神意。","source_cn":"首先，关于弥萨忒的怒火来由，是在于违逆神意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93BBDFE663EA18C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422666002:1":{"text":"对于神魔战争，弥萨忒的意志是远离纷争与战火——在丛林与山川的庇护下宁静度日。","source_cn":"对于神魔战争，弥萨忒的意志是远离纷争与战火——在丛林与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F4B2B346B6323D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422666003:1":{"text":"但当年的贤者们无视了这份嘱托，在面对参战的艾雅与人类一方时，主动出借了翡绿之卵。","source_cn":"但当年的贤者们无视了这份嘱托，在面对参战的艾雅与人类一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x029D20229F4A9FB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422666004:1":{"text":"几乎将整片丛林卷入战火之中——这才是弥萨忒愤怒的主因。","source_cn":"几乎将整片丛林卷入战火之中——这才是弥萨忒愤怒的主因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B95237674F792D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422666005:1":{"text":"也就是说，翡绿之卵的被污染与后续的冲突，并不是起因，而是火上浇油。","source_cn":"也就是说，翡绿之卵的被污染与后续的冲突，并不是起因，而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B046DCAB10D648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422666006:1":{"text":"是的，所以弥萨忒的惩戒才会那样严苛。","source_cn":"是的，所以弥萨忒的惩戒才会那样严苛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BCA73B4ACE8F0F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422666007:1":{"text":"祂将那些人剥离了，正如将翡绿之卵被污染的部分剥离了一样。","source_cn":"祂将那些人剥离了，正如将翡绿之卵被污染的部分剥离了一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F1130E49E6787AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422666008:0":{"text":"剥离……那是指用诅咒将我们从薄暮丛林驱逐吗？","source_cn":"剥离……那是指用诅咒将我们从薄暮丛林驱逐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0890869F32FCA35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422666009:0":{"text":"嗯，事实上，那是剥离的一部分。","source_cn":"嗯，事实上，那是剥离的一部分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32B0ABBD4ADF260C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422666010:1":{"text":"弥萨忒的子民因祂的祝福，而天然同河川与森林有着血脉相连般的联系。","source_cn":"弥萨忒的子民因祂的祝福，而天然同河川与森林有着血脉相连...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09DD161F188D66B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422666011:1":{"text":"弥萨忒的剥离